description.narrative:
Outcome 1: Female political association/parties members have contributed to decision-making, policymaking and advocacy, as a network and have enhanced their skills;
Outcome 2: Political parties/ political associations and their leadership have enhanced their understanding and skills of the role of political parties, institutional development and policy making.
Cross cutting activities will include the learning that will take out during and after the project implementation including research, monitoring, evaluation, reflection and learning and capacity building of the consortium.
